  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global rights is an internatnional human rights organisation based in Washington, with offices in Asia, Afrika and Latin America. GR operation are built up around three core programmes: 1. Access to justice for poor and marginalized groups 2. Gender Equality and Women&apos;s rights 3. Racial and ethnic discrimination. In addition two special initiatives one on LGBT rights and one Natural resouces</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Global rights &#xe4;r en internationell MR organisation baserad i Washington med kontor i Afghanistan, Algeriet, Burundi, Marocco, DRC, Tunisien,Nigeria, Guinea, Brasilien och Colombia). Deras verksamhet &#xe4;r uppbyggd kring tre huvud program: 1. Tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa f&#xf6;r fattiga och marginaliserade grupper 2. J&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet och kvinnors r&#xe4;ttigheter 3. Diskriminering baserad p&#xe5; ras och etnisk tillh&#xf6;righet</narrative>
  </description>
